//RS //! Typed package variants (E4-JP15 / D-JPK-VARIANT1=D).
//RS //!
//RS //! Closed native axes only: build/host/target role, OS, arch, runtime/libc,
//RS //! linkage, ABI, artifact kind, and feature set. Every axis has a context-
//RS //! derived default so beginners never write variants. Matching is
//RS //! exact-then-compatible under one total order; an ambiguous tie is E1316.
//RS //! Selected variants enter action keys and the semantic lock. Provider facts
//RS //! influence selection only through explicit `variant_map` entries.
//RS 
//RS use crate::Diagnostics::Diagnostic;
//RS use crate::Platform::{self, PlatformKey};
//RS use std::collections::{BTreeMap, BTreeSet};
